kmap 1
id cz-qwerty_bksl
layout cz
variant qwerty_bksl
name Czech (QWERTY, extra backslash)
level3 ralt
key TLDE ; dead_abovering ` ~
key AE01 + 1 ! dead_tilde
key AE02 ě 2 @ dead_caron
key AE03 š 3 '#' dead_circumflex
key AE04 č 4 $ dead_breve
key AE05 ř 5 % dead_abovering
key AE06 ž 6 ^ dead_ogonek
key AE07 ý 7 & dead_grave
key AE08 á 8 * dead_abovedot
key AE09 í 9 ( dead_acute
key AE10 é 0 ) dead_doubleacute
key AE11 = % \ dead_diaeresis
key AE12 dead_acute dead_caron dead_macron dead_cedilla
key AD01 q Q \ Ω caps
key AD02 w W | § caps
key AD03 e E € E caps
key AD04 r R ¶ ® caps
key AD05 t T ŧ Ŧ caps
key AD06 y Y ← ¥ caps
key AD07 u U ↓ ↑ caps
key AD08 i I → ı caps
key AD09 o O ø Ø caps
key AD10 p P þ Þ caps
key AD11 ú / [ {
key AD12 ) ( ] }
key BKSL \ | / |
key AC01 a A ~ Æ caps
key AC02 s S đ ẞ caps
key AC03 d D Đ Ð caps
key AC04 f F [ ª caps
key AC05 g G ] Ŋ caps
key AC06 h H ` Ħ caps
key AC07 j J '''' dead_horn caps
key AC08 k K ł & caps
key AC09 l L Ł Ł caps
key AC10 ů " ; :
key AC11 § ! '''' ß
key LSGT \ | / ¦
key AB01 z Z ° < caps
key AB02 x X '#' > caps
key AB03 c C & © caps
key AB04 v V @ ‚ caps
key AB05 b B { ‘ caps
key AB06 n N } ’ caps
key AB07 m M ^ º caps
key AB08 , ? < ×
key AB09 . : > ÷
key AB10 - _ * dead_abovedot
key SPCE space space space space
key KPDL KP_Delete KP_Decimal
